+From 708e6392af27d520b14df4f0473bc0d8896075b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Gianni Spadoni <me@gio.blue>
+Date: Sun, 25 Jan 2026 17:14:23 +0800
+Subject: [PATCH 14/20] arm64: dts: qcom: Enable GPU on Ayn Odin 3
+
+Adds device tree support for the GPU used on the Odin 3
+
+Requires gxcc / gpucc driver for SM8750 and support for 830 / 44050001 added to the Adreno driver
+
+Signed-off-by: Gianni Spadoni <me@gio.blue>
+---
+ arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750-ayn-odin3.dts |  24 +-
+ arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750-gpu.dtsi      | 300 ++++++++++++++++++
