+From 7bf16efacffb6987affc9a0487b7776c85773f82 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Teguh Sobirin <teguh@sobir.in>
+Date: Mon, 21 Apr 2025 18:16:35 +0800
+Subject: [PATCH 18/20] input: RSInput: Add regulator
+
+Signed-off-by: Teguh Sobirin <teguh@sobir.in>
+---
